    "insights": [
      "Resolvent R(λ,a) = (λ·1 - a)⁻¹ factors as λ⁻¹·(1 - λ⁻¹a)⁻¹, reducing to Neumann series",
      "First resolvent identity R(λ)-R(μ) = (μ-λ)R(λ)R(μ) is purely algebraic, needs only unit manipulation",
      "Norm bound ‖R(λ,a)‖ ≤ 1/(‖λ‖-‖a‖) follows from Neumann norm bound composed with factorization",
      "Full HFC f(a) = (2πi)⁻¹∮f(λ)R(λ,a)dλ needs Banach-space-valued contour integration not yet in Mathlib"
    ],
